<title>SOUTH KOREA: Ssangyong Oil CDU restarts operation.</title>
<headline>Ssangyong Oil CDU restarts operation.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's Ssangyong Oil Refining Co, a unit of Ssangyong Group, said on Friday it had restarted its No 2 crude distillation unit (CDU) after an annual maintenance shutdown.</p>
<p>The 150,000 barrels-per-day (bpd) CDU was closed down on May 6, a company spokesman said.</p>
<p>Ssangyong, South Korea's third largest oil refiner in terms of capacity, has refining capability of 443,000 bpd.</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5643</p>
</text>
